<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 761 0 R
/E (Supermarkets present a unique challenge called "Perishability"\(goods that have a limited shelf life and will spoil\). Unlike a hardware store or bookstore, a supermarket deals with items that expire . This forces the system to handle FEFO \(First Expired, First Out\) logic, which adds significant complexity to the project)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
